  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>Iconic 1995 silhouette returns, restored to original specifications\nLayered upper teams mesh and leather panels for comfort and structure\nReflective elements stand out for style in low-light conditions\nLace closure with accented loop eyelets ensures a secure, stylish fit\nEnlarged heel Air unit offers plush cushioning and OG-inspired style\nFlex grooves in the sole unit offer a naturally comfortable stride\nRugged rubber outsole delivers enhanced traction and durability\nThe Nike Air Max 95 Big Bubble Casual Shoes are imported.\nCelebrate over three decades of revolutionary design with the Men's Nike Air Max 95 Big Bubble Casual Shoes, a game-changing silhouette that still hits just as hard today. Originally built for performance running, the AM95 became iconic in street culture thanks to its human-anatomy-inspired layered upper. This remastered rendition stays true to the mid-'90s legend, packing the signature visible forefoot and heel Air units that forever altered the sneaker landscape.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's Nike Air Max 95 Big Bubble Casual Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Adult</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Ashen Slate/Midnight Navy/Light Armory Blue/Light Armory Blue</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</